'''Chroma Candleflame''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2021 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2021|2021 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
It has a solid black handle in the shape of an antique candlestick with a color-alternating blade resembling a flame on a candle igniting from it, hence the name. On the surface of the handle below the blade is a beam of radiant color-alternating light.

== Trivia ==
*It is the [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart of the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife under the name [[Candleflame]], which was found in the same box.
* It was a victim of [[The Candleflame Glitch (2021)]], causing [[Nikilis]] to ban people with ten or more of this item.
** This seems to have been removed, though, as there currently are players owning ten or more of this item. 
* It is the third holiday [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] and the second Halloween chroma to be released inside the game, the others being [[Chroma Traveler's Gun]], [[Chroma Elderwood Blade]], and [[Chroma Boneblade]].
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].
*Like all the other [[Chroma Weapons]], it is not salvageable in the crafting station.
*It has been partnered with the rare gun under the same name from the 2024 Halloween event.

